,"shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","review_id":"HkDaIVmLAgJWCHrhp73_9g","date":"2011-07-22T15:31:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9288105964660645,"text_excerpt":"Our go-to place for pizza. The pizza is consistently good, with a not-too-thin and not-too-thick crust. The toppings are fresh, and they don't overdo either the sauce or the cheese. I would also recommend the hummus and the salads, both are excellent. Service is good, too and prices are reasonable. Not the best place for ambiance, as it can get noisy when crowded, but hey, it's a pizza parlor!"},{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","review_id":"KYEHGCWW12c44pDnD-6bkA","date":"2013-12-01T16:58:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9281904101371765,"text_excerpt":"Reginelli's has great pizza and sometimes I think they are underrated. I recently have been enjoying some speciality pizzas and find that the service is always consistently helpful and friendly. The crust is on the thinner side but not too thin, I like it because its never soggy. The small pizza is the perfect split for 2 people. They also have sandwiches and salad that are good, but the pizza always brings me back. My go to pizza is the Smokin' Chicken (Spicy smoked tomato sauce, marinated chicken breast, mozzarella, caramelized onions, pancetta, green onions.) YUM =)"},{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","review_id":"M5A23NvmAMbVDuFhJi4VPg","date":"2018-11-26T08:33:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9185453653335571,"text_excerpt":"Love their pizzas and salads. They deliver very quickly and have many options to customize your pizza beyond the traditional options. Nice that delivery was free too since I live nearby."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","photo_id":"7uTbbnT-UajfYrG7brO2nw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7uTbbnT-UajfYrG7brO2nw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9167735576629639},{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","photo_id":"xhqlWvNhpevt-YzjxTlzaQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xhqlWvNhpevt-YzjxTlzaQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8516039252281189},{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","photo_id":"vcscgs10nzVjQFgADwPPoQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vcscgs10nzVjQFgADwPPoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8211721777915955},{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","photo_id":"uEHjs-ciwIupVwbB9l8bSg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uEHjs-ciwIupVwbB9l8bSg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8048425912857056},{"business_id":"QQng-ifjEZhI1Vb9j0Hb4A","photo_id":"-_t7LNRxfJ8a5QBcmMia1Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-_t7LNRxfJ8a5QBcmMia1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7926758527755737}]},"notebook_case":null}
